msgid "RC Input"
msgstr "RC 输入"

#: ../../source/docs/common-radiolinkpix6.rst:511
#: 149cce91d46548b984f55f73482a658b 4916a1a2e0754c2588e4bcb78a2f4c0f
#: 9daa04b9f01444dea96897fa0a6d904d c4f9a1e588ee4f5fb87c9ff5d482ba24
#: d4c3decdb3174d05af5641d7c92939e9 f064a73a86d249fba287a81617b1d839
msgid ""
"The RCIN pin, which by default is mapped to a timer input, can be used for "
"all ArduPilot supported receiver protocols, except CRSF/ELRS and SRXL2 which"
" require a true UART connection. However, FPort, when connected in this "
"manner, will only provide RC without telemetry."
msgstr ""
"RCIN 引脚默认映射为定时器输入，可用于所有 ArduPilot 支持的接收机协议，但 CRSF/ELRS 和 SRXL2 除外（这两种协议需要真正的"
" UART 连接）。但 FPort 以此方式连接时，仅提供 RC 而无数传。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-radiolinkpix6.rst:513
#: 0f6a7a58539347a88011fd1aff998984 0f82afa227bc4cd9aa05477912b452e4
#: 22561004e63f469cade14daacd235104 2b4bb0de2e6a444e95936d1e4137efeb
#: 5a6824462ba54ffcac9f121e4dac8227 bbef7db71ceb4d18a5d785889f41aeca
msgid ""
"To allow CRSF and embedded telemetry available in Fport, CRSF, and SRXL2 "
"receivers, a full UART with DMA capability, such as SERIAL1 (USART2) would "
"need to be used for receiver connections. Below are setups using Serial6."
msgstr ""
"要支持 FPort、CRSF 和 SRXL2 接收机中的 CRSF 和嵌入式数传，需要使用具有 DMA 能力的完整 UART（如 "
"SERIAL1（USART2））进行接收机连接。以下是使用 Serial6 的配置示例。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-radiolinkpix6.rst:516
#: 331165e679b44b6884da819daa9ebf21 945781c1de4840d4bc42a419d1b71a12
#: a088c489d5af4f2aaa32a1691dddb8d3 abd7a15dc0ca4477ac4e9e023ef2c212
#: d18d1eeb3edc44aeb8f1db63431244c2 dbd9712f47684fc9a305d26538d2bb34
msgid ":ref:`SERIAL1_PROTOCOL <SERIAL1_PROTOCOL>` should be set to “23”."
msgstr ":ref:`SERIAL1_PROTOCOL <SERIAL1_PROTOCOL>` 应设置为「23」。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-radiolinkpix6.rst:517
#: 4f59e90434f34a669e503a123c7fc775 73e71d69994e4131af79e728dc49ce53
#: 7bee8ac8a3d640ab9b0685e93f2f9c10 b8ae0252098b4b2098d0a2d7f1b85999
#: d8782f4918f54482b28dd42ac45fba7d fb5425c288394a82a8bd6a20ecb6414b
msgid ""
"FPort would require :ref:`SERIAL1_OPTIONS <SERIAL1_OPTIONS>` be set to “15”."
msgstr "FPort 需要将 :ref:`SERIAL1_OPTIONS <SERIAL1_OPTIONS>` 设置为「15」。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-radiolinkpix6.rst:518
#: 0979cc832ca04fd7b2799811c4966b35 514a6e71c8224c99aae812db80556687
#: 637c3af1604f463d817cfd4c049fd19b ac883e630e164d889636546c2ca2cd72
#: b9a41db33b70477e9dc78fa9755cac77 e6c2950b2bab4318be804d194ab5054e
msgid ""
"CRSF would require :ref:`SERIAL1_OPTIONS <SERIAL1_OPTIONS>` be set to “0”."
msgstr "CRSF 需要将 :ref:`SERIAL1_OPTIONS <SERIAL1_OPTIONS>` 设置为「0」。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-radiolinkpix6.rst:519
#: 4846a1011d7447b6be04f2da8a3fa745 69476bd8d8f943178a7c07822bb2ecb5
#: 6a69388d90b5429987d7d537975cbf4c a260f3850243429f8b53c682c1f8efb8
#: dc0612c40db94eae8278f0fa4bf8f51d dce4d965bbc543a1af774e57ef88a1ab
msgid ""
"SRXL2 would require :ref:`SERIAL1_OPTIONS <SERIAL1_OPTIONS>` be set to “4” "
"and connects only the TX pin."
msgstr ""
"SRXL2 需要将 :ref:`SERIAL1_OPTIONS <SERIAL1_OPTIONS>` 设置为「4」，并且只连接 TX 引脚。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-radiolinkpix6.rst:521
#: 3a18440e13b647f69460641e10114fcb 70e5d6debb44484e8cd71f16edd86d4e
#: 863cbeb6171b4a84bffe23d8230774be b76366a5576347ea8989c4b868fbda6d
#: cfa7f948757e4551a2b3f2ac71ccbacf ffb0ec178bf547afaea4efcb08e7b702
msgid ""
"Any UART can be used for RC system connections in ArduPilot also, and is "
"compatible with all protocols except PPM. See :ref:`common-rc-systems` for "
"details."
msgstr ""
"在 ArduPilot 中，任何 UART 都可用于 RC 系统连接，并兼容除 PPM 外的所有协议。详情请参阅 :ref:`common-rc-"
"systems`。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-radiolinkpix6.rst:524
#: 88a4dfd5c3544a7cb6bf6e85057e1804 8b3b72c8c1dd4afb80fb562e761d2e0f
#: 9412dba76ffe4189a84ec3f243944d47 9fce866eccb141fd8e358dbdd6600e3a
#: ced2ebdefa994528b3f0bdc8e87f71ff f9afc6787e054ed499e16653c62ab6ef
msgid "OSD Support"
msgstr "OSD 支持"

#: ../../source/docs/common-radiolinkpix6.rst:526
#: 66f893a396564a279fd6453ad07d4567 6c197d18174a4f5e89eb7dcd5e99335f
#: 9884525dd7894008bebfbc3d1b3473a1 d3237dfafcdc4898bf00a04044700d47
#: ff5f04ac04a34711892c74840864458c ff941a5876a14234b52266f8520cc601
msgid ""
"The RadiolinkPIX6 support using its internal OSD using OSD_TYPE 1 (MAX7456 "
"driver). External OSD support such as DJI or DisplayPort is supported using "
"UART3 or any other free UART. See :ref:`common-msp-osd-overview-4.2` for "
"more info."
msgstr ""
"RadiolinkPIX6 支持通过 OSD_TYPE 1（MAX7456 驱动）使用其内部 OSD。外部 OSD 支持（如 DJI 或 "
"DisplayPort）可通过 UART3 或任何其他空闲 UART 实现。详情请参见 :ref:`common-msp-osd-"
"overview-4.2`。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-radiolinkpix6.rst:529
#: 1f6920b83a224147a746be0cf0f6d890 8ca2fb9130f149b18282f405a30f8776
#: a8707a05dd4a4e9b94db21d4577811dd a8cbcafc85c74a9baf1bc8d92073a873
#: d4ebff28ad274ecb9bbc771f212084bc dad93866855c4d5682e3862fa1edd875
