#: cb4161b88abf4044989ec9459233940c e1bbcd25d90544778dfa529ddbb48cec
msgid ""
"FMU outputs within the same group need to use the same output rate and "
"protocol, ie. if any output in a group uses DShot then all channels in that "
"group need to use DShot."
msgstr "同一组内的 FMU 输出需要使用相同的输出速率和协议，即如果某组中任何输出使用 DShot，则该组中所有通道都需要使用 DShot。"

